# Google Gemini API Key for ProofTrail
# Get a free key at: https://aistudio.google.com/
#
# OPTIONAL: ProofTrail works out of the box with zero configuration!
# When GEMINI_API_KEY is left blank, ProofTrail runs the built-in sample audit,
# checking sample candidate requirements at runtime against the source text with lib/verifyQuote.ts.
#
# Configure this key ONLY if you want to perform live extraction on custom documents.
GEMINI_API_KEY=""

